    Proceedings of PHYSOR 2008:  Nuclear Power -- A Sustainable     47 1451   69
    Resource (2008).                                                47 1451   70
 3. A. I. Hawari, I. I. Al-Qasir, V. H. Gillette, B. W. Wehring     47 1451   71
    and T. Zhou, "Ab Initio Generation of Thermal Neutron           47 1451   72
